OL,3,C'Justice is served': Survivor speaks
OL,4,Cout as abuser jailed 35 years later
OL,6,FITV Granada Reports' journalist
OL,7,FJennifer Buck has spoken to a victim
OL,8,Fof Malkait Rai, who has just been
OL,9,Fjailed for almost eight years.
OL,11,FA survivor of sexual abuse has said
OL,12,F"justice has been served" after her
OL,13,Fattacker was finally put behind bars
OL,14,F35 years after committing his crimes.
OL,16,FITV News has protected the identity of
OL,17,Fthe woman, now in her 40s, who was
OL,18,Fjust 12 when she was targeted by
OL,19,Fpredator Malkiat Rai in Manchester in
OL,20,Fthe 1990s.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
