OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785349119
OL,3,C'Justice is served': Survivor speaks
OL,4,Cout as abuser jailed 35 years later
OL,6,FRai, who was in his mid-20s when he
OL,7,Fcarried out indecent assaults against
OL,8,Fhis victim, faces seven-and-a-half
OL,9,Fyears in prison for his crimes.
OL,11,FShe says, despite the time that has
OL,12,Fpassed, she has accepted the sentence
OL,13,Fand now wants her voice to be heard.
OL,15,F"No amount of time would have been
OL,16,Fenough for me, but the main thing for
OL,17,Fme is that justice has been served and
OL,18,FI have been heard," she said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
