CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785349119
OL,3,C'Justice is served': Survivor speaks
OL,4,Cout as abuser jailed 35 years later
OL,6,FWhen asked how the last 35 years have
OL,7,Fbeen and how much those memories
OL,8,Fremain with her while her attacker
OL,9,Fbuilt a life and grew up, she
OL,10,Fexplained the daily toll it takes
OL,11,F"every day".
OL,13,F"If you are walking down the street
OL,14,Fand you see a person who looks a
OL,15,Fcertain way," she said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
