PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785349119
OL,3,C'Justice is served': Survivor speaks
OL,4,Cout as abuser jailed 35 years later
OL,6,F"If I smell cigarettes - it just
OL,7,Finstantly takes me back to when
OL,8,FMalkiat had covered my face, covered
OL,9,Fmy mouth to stop me from screaming or
OL,10,Fshouting. All I could smell on his
OL,11,Fhands was stale cigarettes.
OL,13,F"I can't stop people smoking, but what
OL,14,FI can do is stop these memories and
OL,15,Fthoughts traumatising me - I can do
OL,16,Fthat."
OL,18,FMalkiat Rai was known to the family.
OL,19,FThe legal process has taken several
OL,20,Fyears of the woman's life.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
