FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785349119
OL,3,C'Justice is served': Survivor speaks
OL,4,Cout as abuser jailed 35 years later
OL,6,FExplaining why she chose to speak out,
OL,7,Fshe said she wants other survivors to
OL,8,Ftake away a message of hope: "Hope,
OL,9,Fyou are believed, you know the truth
OL,10,Fcome out. It is not just for me that
OL,11,FI've done this.
OL,13,F"What's happened to me has been
OL,14,Fhorrific and that's on me, but what I
OL,15,Fhave done for you is I have put away a
OL,16,Fsex offender."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
